<title>USA: NVR sets additional $12 mln stock buyback.</title>
<headline>NVR sets additional $12 mln stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NVR Inc on Wednesday said it will spend up to $12 million for the repurchase of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company indicated that the current authorization is a continuation of the stock repurchase program that began three years ago and is consistent with NVR's strategy of maximizing shareholder value.</p>
<p>NVR which currently has 11,717,000 shares of common stock outstanding, the company said.</p>
</text>
